\\ expect 8:20 Reply is an outcome of a remote perform: a program takes outcomes apart with match and cannot make one
\\ Outcomes come from the system only.

(remote-effect Ledger
  (read-only total Unit --> I64))

(define main {I64 --> I64}
  input -> (match (Reply input)
             ((Reply n) -> n)
             (NotDelivered -> -1)
             (TimedOut -> -2)))
